# NAME: dxFeed
# TYPE: data
# REPO: https://github.com/kevshen13/surge-rules
# UPDATED: 2026-11-12
# ROUTING: Choose an independent policy for each list; app and feed exits need not match.
# ORDER: Place data-source DOMAIN/IP rules before program PROCESS-NAME rules.
# GATEWAY: PROCESS-NAME identifies only processes on the Surge host, not remote LAN PCs.
# SOURCE: https://kb.dxfeed.com/en/getting-started.html
# SOURCE: https://docs.dxfeed.com/dxfeed/api/com/dxfeed/api/DXEndpoint.html
# NOTE: Dedicated/white-label endpoints outside dxfeed.com require a specific observed hostname; never add a whole shared CDN/ASN.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dxfeed.com
DOMAIN,dxfeed-retail.zendesk.com
DOMAIN,dxfeed.github.io
